{"ref":"BDB, גְּלִילָה","hw":"גְּלִילָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלִילָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. circuit, boundary, territory</strong> —<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.8\">Ez 47:8</a>; elsewhere pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלִילוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:2\" href=\"/Joshua.13.2\">Jos 13:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:10\" href=\"/Joshua.22.10\">22:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:11\" href=\"/Joshua.22.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jo 4:4</a>;—belonging to a people <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־גְּלִילוֹת הַפְּלִשְׁתִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:2\" href=\"/Joshua.13.2\">Jos 13:2</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:4\" href=\"/Joel.4.4\">Jo 4:4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כֹּל ג׳ פְּלָ֑שֶׁת)</span>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ הַיַּרְדֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:10\" href=\"/Joshua.22.10\">Jos 22:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:11\" href=\"/Joshua.22.11\">11</a> according to some, but v. foll.; abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.8\">Ez 47:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגּ׳ הַקַּדְמוֹנָה</span>; as <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.29\">2 K 15:29</a> <em>Galilee</em>, 𝔊 Γαλιλαια (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּל אֶרֶץ נַפְתָּלִי</span>) cf. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּלִיל²\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּלִיל²\", dir=\"rtl\">גָּלִיל</a>.","next":"BDB, גְּלִילוֹת","prev":"BDB, גָּלִיל²"}